&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: center; line-height: 1"&gt;②&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; width: 205.6px; vertical-align: middle; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; line-height: 1; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;顧客や投資家の環境志向の高まり&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; width: 264px; vertical-align: middle; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; line-height: 1; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;短期～中期におけるリスクは低いものの、昨年度と比較して発生確率は上昇&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
